  "limitations": "At least four strictly increasing finite knots, at most 256 knots and 512 query points. No smoothing, uncertainty estimate or multidimensional interpolation. Extrapolation evaluates the outer cubic and can be misleading.",
  "port_notes": "The endpoint condition and interpolating spline are preserved. Upstream solves a banded coefficient system with LAPACK; this port solves the algebraically equivalent tridiagonal second-derivative system and a scaled four-point endpoint solve. Natural endpoints expose upstream bctype=1 with zero second derivatives. No LAPACK dependency.",
